OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor with a stoma 'made
OL,4,Ato feel like a criminal' at airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cancer survivor said he was screamed
OL,7,Fat by airport security staff and "made
OL,8,Fto feel like a criminal" after trying
OL,9,Fto retrieve his stoma supplies from his
OL,10,Fluggage.
OL,12,FPaul Scanlon, from Cardiff, has had a
OL,13,Fstoma for nearly four years after being
OL,14,Fdiagnosed with stage three bowel cancer
OL,15,Fand said he had suffered "degrading"
OL,16,Fand "humiliating" treatment at UK
OL,17,Fairports.
OL,19,FNow, a charity wants better training
OL,20,Ffor airport staff so people with stomas
OL,21,Fare treated with "dignity" and
OL,22,F"respect".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
