OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor with a stoma 'made
OL,4,Ato feel like a criminal' at airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Civil Aviation Authority (CAA)
OL,7,Fsaid airports must ensure staff have
OL,8,Fdisability awareness training and that
OL,9,Fsecurity officers were expected to
OL,10,Ftreat people in a "sensitive and
OL,11,Funderstanding" way.
